ng it all together: Harry is nice, which makes him cold. Harry is round, so being round and cold makes him blue. Blue things are big, so Harry is big. All the connections seem to check out without any contradictions.\n\nSo, based on the logical deductions, Harry must be blue. Therefore, the statement \"Harry is blue\" is true.\n</think>\n\nThe statement \"Harry is blue\" is **True**.\n\n**Answer: A) True**",
