plications step by step.\n\nGary is green (9) and young (10). Green people are nice (14), so Gary is nice. All nice people are quiet (15), so Gary is quiet. Quiet and nice people are rough (17), so Gary is rough.\n\nYes, that seems consistent. So the statement \"Gary is rough\" is true based on the given context.\n</think>\n\nThe context provides that Gary is green and young. Since green people are nice, Gary is nice. All nice people are quiet, so Gary is quiet. Quiet and nice people are rough, so Gary is rough. Therefore, the statement is true.\n\n**Answer: A) True**",
