ement 14 says that if someone is nice and young, they see the rabbit. So if the mouse is nice and young, it must see the rabbit. Therefore, the mouse must see the rabbit.\n\nTherefore, the statement \"The mouse sees the rabbit\" is true.\n</think>\n\nThe mouse sees the rabbit because the mouse is cold and young, which makes it nice. Being nice and young, the mouse sees the rabbit. Additionally, the mouse eats the rabbit, which requires the mouse to see it. Therefore, the statement is true.\n\n**Answer: A) True**",
